WEBVTT

00:09.676 --> 00:10.719
Hey, Jun-tae, look.

00:10.802 --> 00:14.222
Fighting is about getting
the upper hand, no matter what. Okay?

00:14.723 --> 00:17.434
Just one kick like this

00:17.517 --> 00:19.394
will definitely scare your opponent.

00:20.520 --> 00:21.771
Let's give it a try.

00:25.358 --> 00:26.359
Damn it.

00:27.318 --> 00:28.194
Hey, man.

00:28.278 --> 00:30.780
What's wrong with your body?

00:30.864 --> 00:31.865
That kid…

00:32.907 --> 00:34.034
He can't be helped.

00:34.117 --> 00:37.120
That coaching sucks.

00:37.787 --> 00:39.789
Then why don't you teach him?

00:39.873 --> 00:40.707
Nope.

00:41.583 --> 00:47.213
I no longer teach anybody how to fight.

00:51.885 --> 00:52.886
You know what?

00:54.387 --> 00:55.972
Gotak, that bastard.

00:57.557 --> 01:00.477
He used to be a Tae Kwon Do athlete.

01:03.229 --> 01:05.231
But he got hurt hanging out with me.

01:08.651 --> 01:11.362
He injured his knee and was hospitalized.

01:12.989 --> 01:15.533
"I'm afraid your athlete days are over."

01:16.117 --> 01:17.619
That's what the doc said

01:19.037 --> 01:21.122
while his mother cried next to him.

01:23.166 --> 01:24.709
I was fucking pissed.

01:25.710 --> 01:28.505
I wanted to kill the assholes
who did that to Gotak.

01:38.098 --> 01:39.808
Much later, I came to realize

01:41.851 --> 01:43.353
that the hardest part…

01:47.524 --> 01:50.276
was thinking it was all my fault.

02:00.662 --> 02:03.289
Anyway, how did I feel back then?

02:03.790 --> 02:04.624
Well…

02:05.166 --> 02:08.086
Man, I suddenly forgot the word.
What was it?

02:08.169 --> 02:09.087
Guilt.

02:09.170 --> 02:10.296
Yeah, that.

02:14.968 --> 02:16.803
I also had a friend like that.

02:45.540 --> 02:48.376
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

03:47.894 --> 03:49.145
Su-ho.

03:51.064 --> 03:52.023
I'm sorry.

04:03.076 --> 04:04.244
Did you sleep well?

04:13.378 --> 04:15.296
Hey, you slept for a long time.

04:18.424 --> 04:20.593
I almost died running with you on my back.

04:21.094 --> 04:22.303
Why are you so heavy?

04:24.847 --> 04:25.682
What happened?

04:26.724 --> 04:29.978
Well, Seong-je was unlucky and got caught.

04:30.061 --> 04:31.479
We managed to escape.

04:32.063 --> 04:32.897
No problem.

04:36.317 --> 04:37.151
Hey, anyway…

04:39.445 --> 04:40.697
thanks, and I'm sorry.

04:44.701 --> 04:46.703
I'll make sure this never happens again.

04:50.540 --> 04:52.166
Will you go and fight again?

04:55.920 --> 04:56.754
What?

04:57.630 --> 04:58.506
If you do…

05:01.926 --> 05:03.469
will it change anything?

05:09.058 --> 05:11.394
This situation will only repeat itself.

05:16.065 --> 05:18.109
In the end, someone will get hurt.

05:25.908 --> 05:26.909
And after that…

05:35.335 --> 05:36.419
Why is Na Baek-jin…

05:38.421 --> 05:39.797
acting that way toward you?

05:39.881 --> 05:40.715
Hit him again.

05:40.798 --> 05:42.383
- Hey, hit him harder!
- Hey!

05:42.967 --> 05:44.052
You assholes!

05:44.135 --> 05:45.720
I said to leave Baek-jin alone.

05:45.803 --> 05:46.804
Are you okay?

05:48.097 --> 05:48.931
Baku.

05:56.064 --> 05:56.898
We're just…

05:59.984 --> 06:01.110
childhood friends.

06:08.868 --> 06:13.748
NA BAEK-JIN

06:26.928 --> 06:27.762
Where are you?

06:28.596 --> 06:30.306
Seong-je is at the police station.

06:33.768 --> 06:35.103
I lost, Baek-jin.

06:37.355 --> 06:38.189
What?

06:42.610 --> 06:44.320
That's what you wanted, isn't it?

06:47.532 --> 06:49.784
You don't actually care about Eunjang.

06:50.910 --> 06:52.578
You just wanted me to say I lost.

06:53.079 --> 06:55.456
That I'm the underdog, no?

07:00.837 --> 07:02.004
What I want?

07:11.639 --> 07:12.515
Fine.

07:14.517 --> 07:15.393
I understand.

07:31.117 --> 07:32.785
Man, fuck this.

07:39.834 --> 07:40.751
Hey.

07:45.882 --> 07:47.133
What's with you?

07:48.176 --> 07:49.385
You came to meet me?

08:06.402 --> 08:07.653
Don't you hate this place?

08:09.155 --> 08:10.156
What do you mean?

08:13.951 --> 08:15.244
It's filthy here,

08:16.579 --> 08:18.498
but you're a fucking neat freak.

08:19.749 --> 08:23.753
You bring punks here that don't listen
and then beat them to a pulp.

08:24.754 --> 08:27.048
I bet you'd find a ton of bloodstains.

08:33.763 --> 08:36.265
And it smells like shit here. Fuck.

08:44.315 --> 08:46.150
What did you say to the police?

08:50.238 --> 08:51.072
What?

08:54.158 --> 08:55.493
Our burner bank account.

08:57.662 --> 08:59.330
Only the two of us have access.

09:15.012 --> 09:15.846
I just said…

09:18.099 --> 09:19.976
I was taking money from Eunjang punks

09:21.060 --> 09:22.228
and got in a fight.

09:22.728 --> 09:23.646
Happy?

09:29.068 --> 09:31.445
But you haven't fucking asked…

09:33.573 --> 09:34.574
if I'm okay.

09:39.996 --> 09:40.830
That's right.

09:42.456 --> 09:44.667
I wondered why you brought me here.

09:48.129 --> 09:51.841
If I fucked up with the police,

09:51.924 --> 09:54.260
were you planning to beat me to death?

09:56.095 --> 09:56.929
Huh?

09:58.222 --> 09:59.056
So what?

10:01.934 --> 10:05.021
We're both assholes,
but I thought we were on the same side.

10:09.108 --> 10:10.776
I'm taking a break from all this.

10:12.695 --> 10:13.779
Don't look for me.

11:08.793 --> 11:10.961
The boss wants to see you. Get in.

11:15.591 --> 11:16.926
I'll reach out to him.

11:17.802 --> 11:18.761
You can leave.

11:19.553 --> 11:21.222
Fucking asshole.

11:24.642 --> 11:25.601
Hey, high schooler.

11:27.978 --> 11:29.313
Have you lost your mind?

11:33.651 --> 11:34.777
You fucking asshole.

11:40.032 --> 11:40.866
You damn punk!

11:41.867 --> 11:42.868
You asshole. Hey!

11:51.335 --> 11:52.753
Fucker.

11:55.923 --> 11:57.216
Fucking asshole.

12:02.012 --> 12:03.639
Fucking piece of shit.

12:18.946 --> 12:20.531
What do you think you're doing?

12:22.533 --> 12:24.076
I'll reach out to him.

12:30.374 --> 12:32.877
Pork belly. Do you want to eat pork belly?

12:32.960 --> 12:35.171
Hey, do you know any good places?

12:35.254 --> 12:37.173
I know an all-you-can-eat place.

12:37.256 --> 12:39.884
- All you can eat?
- For 13,000 won.

12:39.967 --> 12:42.970
Gotak, you're buying
if you can't reach that.

12:43.053 --> 12:43.971
For real?

12:44.054 --> 12:44.972
Reach what?

12:45.055 --> 12:46.932
- You said you could reach that.
- Hey!

12:47.433 --> 12:48.392
Yeon Si-eun!

12:50.895 --> 12:54.899
Si-eun, I've been waiting forever for you!

13:00.112 --> 13:00.946
What's going on?

13:01.030 --> 13:04.366
What do you mean?
We're waiting to walk with you!

13:04.450 --> 13:06.952
You slowpoke! Let's go!

13:07.495 --> 13:08.579
Come on.

13:08.662 --> 13:09.622
Let's go, Si-eun.

13:09.705 --> 13:10.790
Let's go!

13:13.042 --> 13:14.668
- Hurry up!
- Yeah, hurry up.

13:24.720 --> 13:25.805
Let's go.

13:25.888 --> 13:27.681
Let's do it!

13:27.765 --> 13:32.686
At last, we've melted
our dear ice princess.

13:33.896 --> 13:35.064
Princess?

13:35.147 --> 13:38.025
- The value of this function…
- Hi. Hello, my brothers.

13:38.108 --> 13:39.109
Are you studying?

13:39.193 --> 13:41.403
You're bothering Si-eun again, you punk.

13:41.946 --> 13:43.989
Stop bothering Si-eun while he's studying.

13:44.490 --> 13:48.118
Okay, what's this 2XL?
Are you measuring sizes?

13:48.202 --> 13:49.537
Is this a weapon box?

13:52.456 --> 13:55.084
Si-eun-chan, shall we do a snack run?

13:55.793 --> 13:56.627
- Yeah?
- Hey!

13:56.710 --> 13:57.962
It's only first period.

13:58.045 --> 13:59.046
Yes, I know.

13:59.129 --> 14:00.548
But what day is it?

14:01.048 --> 14:03.342
It's the day Gotak treats everyone!

14:04.051 --> 14:05.302
What's this bullshit?

14:05.386 --> 14:07.721
No, you clearly said it was your treat!

14:07.805 --> 14:09.807
- Block Jun-tae!
- Si-eun is under the net.

14:09.890 --> 14:11.016
Over here!

14:12.226 --> 14:13.853
Hey, shoot!

14:14.770 --> 14:16.188
- Damn it.
- Nice job!

14:18.816 --> 14:20.109
Block with your body!

14:21.068 --> 14:22.486
Shoot it!

14:22.570 --> 14:24.572
- Si-eun can't do it.
- Shoot! Let's go!

14:26.073 --> 14:28.284
Hey, see that? You didn't have to block.

14:28.367 --> 14:31.036
No one was blocking you,
and you missed it!

14:36.792 --> 14:37.626
This is nice.

14:40.296 --> 14:42.756
Man, it's almost too peaceful.

14:45.384 --> 14:46.802
Those Union punks

14:47.845 --> 14:50.014
definitely won't just let it go.

14:50.890 --> 14:52.558
I took care of everything.

14:53.100 --> 14:54.518
So don't worry about it.

14:55.060 --> 14:56.645
Just enjoy the peace.

14:58.856 --> 15:00.065
Did you meet Baek-jin?

15:00.566 --> 15:02.693
No, I didn't, you punk.

15:03.694 --> 15:08.073
Anyway, you don't have to worry
about stuff like the Union anymore, okay?

15:09.491 --> 15:12.369
Oh man, this is nice!

15:16.332 --> 15:17.166
What?

15:21.420 --> 15:22.588
Hello?

15:22.671 --> 15:26.634
This is the Yeongdeungpo Police Station.
Are you Mr. Park Jin-cheol's son?

15:32.681 --> 15:33.682
Yes, I understand.

15:37.561 --> 15:38.646
Hey, what's going on?

15:39.188 --> 15:40.022
What?

15:40.689 --> 15:41.607
It's nothing.

15:43.233 --> 15:45.235
Hey, something came up, so I'm gonna go.

15:45.319 --> 15:46.403
- Okay.
- Bye.

15:48.280 --> 15:49.573
What, just like that?

15:50.074 --> 15:52.076
You said it was nothing, you punk!

15:54.119 --> 15:55.162
Hey, Park Hu-min!

15:59.041 --> 16:02.002
The kids have changed their story.

16:02.544 --> 16:04.838
Now they claim Mr. Park
never checked their IDs,

16:04.922 --> 16:06.548
so they won't sign their statements.

16:08.550 --> 16:10.260
So your father lost it, and, well…

16:11.720 --> 16:14.473
It's not okay to beat minors
in a police station.

16:14.556 --> 16:16.392
SEOUL YEONGDEUNGPO POLICE STATION

16:51.343 --> 16:52.219
NA BAEK-JIN

16:52.720 --> 16:55.806
The number you have dialed is unavailable…

16:59.935 --> 17:01.895
BAEK-JIN: JOIN THE UNION.
THAT'S WHAT I WANT.

17:01.979 --> 17:04.940
THEN I WON'T MESS WITH YOUR FATHER,
HIS BUSINESS, OR YOUR FRIENDS.

17:08.485 --> 17:11.238
That fucking old man slapped me hard.

17:11.321 --> 17:12.906
Fuck. I thought I might die.

17:14.116 --> 17:16.994
How bad can it be?
He fries chicken for a living, dumbass.

17:18.954 --> 17:21.040
Hey, was that Baku just now?

17:22.207 --> 17:24.835
Baku or Fuck-u, what's he going to do?

17:59.244 --> 18:00.746
- Yes?
- Baek-jin.

18:00.829 --> 18:03.165
I heard Park Hu-min
beat up our boys again.

18:04.625 --> 18:06.502
What should I do about that fucker?

18:07.544 --> 18:08.796
Do I send in more guys?

18:11.340 --> 18:12.174
Leave him be.

18:13.175 --> 18:14.009
What?

18:14.802 --> 18:16.011
Just leave him be.

18:17.679 --> 18:19.056
Baku is doing a great job.

18:31.110 --> 18:31.944
Oh yeah!

18:39.326 --> 18:40.202
My turn, bro.

18:45.290 --> 18:46.542
That fucking bastard.

18:47.918 --> 18:49.128
Mr. Choi is here.

18:51.463 --> 18:53.715
Those motherfuckers.

18:59.930 --> 19:01.014
How have you been?

19:02.724 --> 19:03.934
What brings you here?

19:09.314 --> 19:10.524
What brings me here?

19:12.818 --> 19:15.487
Do I need to ask permission

19:15.571 --> 19:17.114
to visit my own business?

19:24.288 --> 19:25.122
Sit.

19:44.683 --> 19:45.684
Any issues?

19:48.020 --> 19:48.854
None.

19:54.443 --> 19:57.863
If there are no issues, why did I get
a call from the police station?

20:01.575 --> 20:02.826
Who was it again?

20:05.204 --> 20:07.331
Geum Seong-je? Goddamn it.

20:11.126 --> 20:12.920
Do your job right, Baek-jin,

20:14.213 --> 20:16.256
before I step in, okay?

20:22.012 --> 20:23.472
Don't make me come back here.

20:46.328 --> 20:47.579
Sit down.

20:52.918 --> 20:55.587
The bruises on your face,
and you missing cram school.

20:56.630 --> 20:58.548
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

20:59.258 --> 21:02.135
What the hell are you doing
in and out of school?

21:07.766 --> 21:09.184
Get ready to study abroad.

21:10.352 --> 21:14.106
I know that the previous incident
has made it hard to focus.

21:14.606 --> 21:16.775
I've put a lot of thought into this.

21:19.653 --> 21:21.238
Let's just leave Korea and--

21:21.321 --> 21:22.489
I don't want to.

21:25.659 --> 21:27.869
Is it wrong for a mom
to worry about her son?

21:35.919 --> 21:37.170
You will study abroad.

21:38.213 --> 21:39.381
End of discussion.

21:44.094 --> 21:45.304
You can go back…

21:47.472 --> 21:49.933
to living your life
without caring about me.

21:57.899 --> 21:58.734
I thought…

22:04.531 --> 22:06.825
what happened at your previous school was…

22:10.787 --> 22:12.497
all because of me.

22:19.046 --> 22:20.630
Because I was a terrible mom.

22:24.843 --> 22:28.597
I can't let something like that happen
to my son again, can I?

22:32.934 --> 22:35.812
Why is it so hard
for you to understand my feelings?

22:55.749 --> 22:56.583
Su-ho.

22:59.252 --> 23:00.295
If you were here…

23:03.048 --> 23:05.342
what would you tell me at this moment?

23:08.720 --> 23:09.554
You…

23:11.640 --> 23:13.308
always knew what to say.

23:15.936 --> 23:16.770
My mom.

23:18.897 --> 23:19.731
And you.

23:21.566 --> 23:23.068
And all these situations.

23:25.195 --> 23:27.155
It seems like it's all my fault.

23:32.536 --> 23:34.037
I have no idea

23:34.955 --> 23:35.914
what to do.

23:40.085 --> 23:42.421
I heard your mom will handle
your academic records.

23:44.005 --> 23:44.840
Is that right?

23:46.049 --> 23:49.052
High school diplomas
from many international schools

23:49.136 --> 23:50.971
aren't accepted in Korea.

23:51.721 --> 23:53.265
You'll need to study hard.

23:54.307 --> 23:57.519
You'll be in trouble
if you fall in with the wrong crowd again.

23:59.646 --> 24:00.897
- Did you hear?
- What?

24:00.981 --> 24:02.732
Baku got in trouble again.

24:02.816 --> 24:03.650
Again?

24:03.733 --> 24:04.901
Some Union punks.

24:04.985 --> 24:07.904
Baku nearly beat them to death
in front of the police station.

24:07.988 --> 24:10.824
But he just returned
from his last suspension.

24:10.907 --> 24:11.741
I know.

24:11.825 --> 24:14.453
At this rate, it must be Baku's fault,
not the Union's.

24:14.536 --> 24:16.872
What if the fucking Union
comes after us again?

24:16.955 --> 24:19.666
"No fighting," my ass.
Follow your own rules.

24:19.749 --> 24:23.962
Man, the peace was nice while it lasted.
It's going to get crazy again.

24:24.045 --> 24:29.468
- EUNJANG HIGH, NO FIGHTING
- BAKU-

24:45.650 --> 24:47.569
BAEK-JIN: JOIN THE UNION.
THAT'S WHAT I WANT.

24:47.652 --> 24:50.614
THEN I WON'T MESS WITH YOUR FATHER,
HIS BUSINESS, OR YOUR FRIENDS.

24:59.623 --> 25:01.166
Are you skipping school again?

25:04.211 --> 25:05.712
I'm not feeling well.

25:11.343 --> 25:12.260
How so?

25:17.599 --> 25:18.725
It's just a cold.

25:27.150 --> 25:28.443
You little punk.

25:29.069 --> 25:29.903
Hey, brat.

25:30.654 --> 25:32.822
What will you become when you're older?

25:37.410 --> 25:39.246
That's not for you to say, Dad.

25:39.746 --> 25:40.789
What's that?

25:40.872 --> 25:42.332
You little asshole.

25:44.042 --> 25:45.877
Fine, you punk.

25:46.711 --> 25:48.296
Keep on fighting.

25:48.380 --> 25:49.798
Drop out of school.

25:50.549 --> 25:52.342
Go and earn some money instead.

25:53.009 --> 25:54.094
Do you know

25:55.095 --> 25:58.807
how much it costs
to feed and house a punk like you?

25:59.432 --> 26:01.309
Man, fuck this! Seriously!

26:03.478 --> 26:04.771
You little punk.

26:13.029 --> 26:15.782
Fuck, you have no idea
who I'm doing this for.

26:39.556 --> 26:40.473
What do you want?

26:43.310 --> 26:45.228
I gave you enough time to think.

26:46.563 --> 26:47.480
Decide now.

26:48.148 --> 26:49.232
I won't ask again.

26:52.319 --> 26:54.070
The safety of your dad and friends…

26:57.324 --> 27:01.036
The only one who can give you
what you want… is me.

27:05.081 --> 27:06.625
You said you'd do what I want.

27:08.251 --> 27:09.961
I'll do the same in return.

27:45.914 --> 27:47.040
It's not a tough gig.

27:48.917 --> 27:50.377
Some punks from Seoknam High.

27:51.294 --> 27:52.879
Just go and mess them up.

27:59.761 --> 28:00.679
Hey, be quiet.

28:01.179 --> 28:02.389
Don't mess with me.

28:02.472 --> 28:03.556
Shut up, dumbass.

28:10.438 --> 28:12.774
ARE YOU THE SEOKNAM GORILLA?

28:14.401 --> 28:15.527
And who are you?

28:24.077 --> 28:25.328
I asked who you are.

28:26.204 --> 28:27.038
Sorry.

28:27.122 --> 28:29.582
What the fuck are you saying?
You fucking dumbass.

28:33.545 --> 28:34.421
Fucking hilarious!

28:35.380 --> 28:36.715
Fuck, is he serious?

28:40.927 --> 28:41.761
Hey.

28:42.721 --> 28:43.722
Motherfucker.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.735
Take it.

28:56.818 --> 28:59.195
NA BAEK-JIN

29:01.281 --> 29:02.115
Hello?

29:04.033 --> 29:06.035
Seoknam is now part of the Union.

29:07.704 --> 29:08.913
Come by my office.

29:10.206 --> 29:11.166
We need to talk.

29:13.084 --> 29:14.127
Put him back on.

29:18.006 --> 29:19.090
He wants you.

29:30.185 --> 29:32.687
Here. Go get some pain relief patches.

30:08.389 --> 30:09.474
Hey, is this right?

30:10.975 --> 30:12.811
Maybe he went to cram school?

30:12.894 --> 30:13.895
Yeah, maybe.

30:15.438 --> 30:17.023
How did you get my address?

30:18.399 --> 30:19.776
Wait. Si--

30:20.985 --> 30:24.989
Si-eun… Well, our homeroom teacher
gave me your address--

30:25.073 --> 30:27.242
Hey, that's not important right now.

30:28.034 --> 30:30.119
Yeon Si-eun, come on out!

30:31.412 --> 30:32.247
What?

30:32.747 --> 30:33.706
Hey, come on out!

30:34.207 --> 30:35.124
Let's hang out.

30:38.711 --> 30:41.130
Hey, too strong. Switch.

30:42.090 --> 30:43.967
Now, Si-eun, give it a try.

30:49.222 --> 30:51.099
- Amazing!
- Nice, Si-eun.

30:51.683 --> 30:53.101
- Not bad.
- One more time.

30:53.685 --> 30:54.686
Try it again.

30:57.814 --> 30:58.982
What was that?

30:59.065 --> 31:01.109
- No way!
- Hey, you've been practicing!

31:04.153 --> 31:05.363
Are you studying abroad?

31:06.281 --> 31:07.365
When are you leaving?

31:10.702 --> 31:12.453
I'm not really sure yet.

31:14.330 --> 31:15.373
I might go.

31:18.710 --> 31:20.420
Hey, that sounds good.

31:21.212 --> 31:23.256
I've never even been on a plane.

31:29.387 --> 31:31.097
We haven't known each other long,

31:32.181 --> 31:33.182
but I have…

31:35.268 --> 31:36.519
a lot to be sorry about

31:37.937 --> 31:39.606
and a lot to be thankful for.

31:42.942 --> 31:44.277
So it's a shame, man.

31:55.747 --> 31:57.790
What happened to Hu-min?

32:01.252 --> 32:03.004
I've heard some strange rumors.

32:05.340 --> 32:08.301
This isn't the first time
he's been in a fight.

32:09.093 --> 32:10.053
Don't worry.

32:10.553 --> 32:13.222
When he gets back,
I'll knock some sense into him.

32:15.767 --> 32:16.726
Man, forget it.

32:17.310 --> 32:18.895
We have to play one more game.

32:23.441 --> 32:24.359
Hey, Jun-tae!

32:25.193 --> 32:28.112
- What's up with your body. Seriously?
- I scored three shots.

32:28.196 --> 32:29.072
- Three?
- Yeah.

32:29.155 --> 32:31.824
Good job. Hey, but you're too stiff.

32:32.450 --> 32:34.118
Look at this.

32:34.202 --> 32:35.745
One, two, snap.

32:37.330 --> 32:38.581
- Good, huh?
- Yeah.

32:38.665 --> 32:41.709
Snap it away when your hand is at the top.
Not too hard now.

32:41.793 --> 32:43.336
PARK HU-MIN

32:43.962 --> 32:44.796
One, hold it.

32:44.879 --> 32:46.714
- One, two, smoothly!
- One, two, snap.

32:47.298 --> 32:49.342
Oh, that's a shame.
One more. You can do it.

32:49.425 --> 32:51.052
- One more time?
- You can do it.

33:04.524 --> 33:08.903
HIGH-AND-MIGHTY YEON SI-EUN

33:20.832 --> 33:24.002
Hey, stop dribbling.
You have to make a basket!

33:24.085 --> 33:24.919
Where are you?

33:29.924 --> 33:30.758
Nice!

33:31.509 --> 33:32.510
One more time.

33:32.593 --> 33:34.470
- This time, I'll shoot.
- Okay.

33:34.554 --> 33:35.805
None of your business.

33:35.888 --> 33:38.224
- It's 2-1.
- Okay, come on.

33:38.307 --> 33:41.185
Either way, I won't cause you any trouble.

33:41.269 --> 33:43.146
Hey, if you jump like that…

33:45.440 --> 33:46.733
That's not what I meant…

33:54.449 --> 33:55.700
Nice!

33:55.783 --> 33:58.119
- I knew you could score. Nice.
- Nice!

33:58.703 --> 33:59.620
Do it!

34:02.331 --> 34:04.125
Nice. Do it again. Once more.

34:04.208 --> 34:05.877
Try it again! That's it.

34:30.568 --> 34:31.903
We've been waiting for you.

34:32.612 --> 34:33.529
You did well.

34:39.118 --> 34:39.952
Welcome,

34:40.870 --> 34:41.704
Baku.

34:58.971 --> 35:02.433
Sky Airlines would like to make
the final boarding call

35:03.017 --> 35:06.395
for flight 9111.

35:06.479 --> 35:09.482
Boarding for Singapore
will be closing soon.

35:10.316 --> 35:14.779
Passengers departing for Singapore,
please go to gate 23…

35:14.862 --> 35:18.407
I put a ribbon on your suitcase
so it would be easy to find.

35:19.450 --> 35:20.618
Eat this on the flight.

35:26.165 --> 35:27.875
Si-eun.

35:27.959 --> 35:29.460
Let's think positively.

35:30.419 --> 35:32.505
I'll finish up my work and be there soon.

35:34.966 --> 35:35.800
And…

35:37.802 --> 35:38.678
thank you

35:39.887 --> 35:41.139
for understanding me.

35:51.023 --> 35:57.238
SEO JUN-TAE

36:00.700 --> 36:01.701
Just a minute.

36:11.502 --> 36:13.421
Hey, Jun-tae. What is it?

36:15.506 --> 36:16.924
Hey, Si-eun. What's up?

36:20.219 --> 36:21.095
Not much.

36:21.929 --> 36:22.889
What about you?

36:26.851 --> 36:29.478
Well, I forgot to say this last time.

36:35.526 --> 36:36.444
Baku,

36:37.737 --> 36:38.613
Gotak…

36:41.532 --> 36:42.450
and I,

36:43.826 --> 36:47.288
we all know
you visit your friend in the hospital…

36:49.582 --> 36:52.793
and why he's there.

36:59.342 --> 37:00.843
But in my opinion…

37:07.475 --> 37:09.685
it wasn't your fault.

37:13.940 --> 37:15.483
I just wanted to tell you

37:16.359 --> 37:18.569
that it wasn't your fault.

37:37.088 --> 37:38.297
Si-eun, what…

37:39.590 --> 37:40.633
What's wrong?

37:44.387 --> 37:45.554
I don't want to go.

37:47.139 --> 37:47.974
What?

37:55.648 --> 37:56.607
My friends say

37:57.858 --> 37:59.277
that it wasn't my fault.

42:11.111 --> 42:15.032
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
